### 1. Book tomorrow (for stats)
# @name bookTomorrow
POST http://localhost:3000/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{"patient_id": 1, "doctor_id": 2, "appt_datetime": "{{$localDatetime "YYYY-MM-DD" 1 d}} 09:00"}

### 2. Book in two days (for stats)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{"patient_id": 2, "doctor_id": 2, "appt_datetime": "{{$localDatetime "YYYY-MM-DD" 2 d}} 11:00"}

### 3. Invalid: not on a 30-minute boundary
POST http://localhost:3000/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{"patient_id": 1, "doctor_id": 2, "appt_datetime": "{{$localDatetime "YYYY-MM-DD" 3 d}} 09:15"}

### 4. Invalid: in the past
POST http://localhost:3000/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{"patient_id": 1, "doctor_id": 2, "appt_datetime": "2025-01-10 10:00"}

### 5. Doctor stats
GET http://localhost:3000/api/doctors/2/stats

### 6. Book 5 days ahead (to cancel with full refund)
# @name bookFar
POST http://localhost:3000/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{"patient_id": 2, "doctor_id": 3, "appt_datetime": "{{$localDatetime "YYYY-MM-DD" 5 d}} 10:00"}

### 7. Cancel it (more than 48h, so 100%)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/appointments/{{bookFar.response.body.$.id}}/cancel

### 8. Cancel tomorrow's booking (short notice)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/appointments/{{bookTomorrow.response.body.$.id}}/cancel

### 9. Cancel again (already cancelled, so 409)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/appointments/{{bookFar.response.body.$.id}}/cancel

### 10. Fill Dr. Boateng's busy day (12th booking)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{"patient_id": 3, "doctor_id": 1, "appt_datetime": "2027-01-11 16:30"}

### 11. 13th booking (day full, waitlist offered)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{"patient_id": 4, "doctor_id": 1, "appt_datetime": "2027-01-11 16:00"}

### 12. Join the waitlist
POST http://localhost:3000/api/waitlist
Content-Type: application/json

{"patient_id": 4, "doctor_id": 1, "date": "2027-01-11"}

### 13. Cancel one of Dr. Boateng's appointments (frees a slot)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/appointments/1/cancel

### 14. Doctors report
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/doctors

### 15. Busy days report
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/busy-days